  "notSupported": {
    "gcp.sdk": "The Google Cloud Java SDK is not used. Every call goes to the Compute Engine v1 REST API through the engine allow-listed HTTP client, with the service-account JWT-bearer exchange signed by the JDK. The Google libraries are not resolvable in this build environment, and this is the approach the GCP Compute Instance and GCP Kubernetes plugins already use here.",
    "gcp.terraform": "Terraform is not used and is not required. Operations execute directly against the GCP API.",
    "gcp.dependent.delete": "Dependent resources are never deleted automatically. A delete refuses while anything still references the resource, and names what.",
    "gcp.credentials.inline": "A service-account key is never accepted in node configuration. Nodes reference a secret by name; the engine resolves it at execution."
